---
source: tests/cli.rs
expression: "help(&[\"replay\"])"
---
Play back a file written by `watch --record`

Usage: plugii replay [OPTIONS] <FILE>

Arguments:
  <FILE>  

Options:
      --speed <SPEED>  Playback speed: 1, 2, 4, 10, 30 or 60 (`+` / `-` change it) [default: 1]
  -h, --help           Print help
